!!! oculus/scene/manager.mat
!!! Scene manager: ordered, revisioned scene with window management ops.
!!!
!!! The manager maintains the canonical scene: a deterministic ordered
!!! list of windows sorted by workspace and z-index. Every mutation
!!! advances the revision and is atomic — the scene is either old or new.

book oculus.scene.manager

read everything from ny.lang.core
read everything from oculus.window.geometry
read everything from oculus.window.identity
read everything from oculus.window.lifecycle
read everything from oculus.window.record
read everything from oculus.window.viewport
read everything from oculus.window.workspace
read everything from oculus.scene.node

public scene-manager begin record
    field revision as override long
    field viewport as viewport
    field window-count as override long
    field max-windows as override long
end record
